@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# crew#892 CP4 (ZT step 5): the gvisor-runsc installer DaemonSet + its namespace. One namespace
+# (`gvisor-runsc`) + one DaemonSet. The DaemonSet's own Pod template installs /usr/local/bin/runsc
